        {
          "type": "summary",
          "text": "Which CRM platforms do you support?+"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The ones you already run: HubSpot, Zoho, Salesforce and comparable platforms. The training happens inside your live instance, or a sandbox copy if you'd rather, because that's where the stale data and the wins both live."
        },
        {
          "type": "summary",
          "text": "Is this training or consulting? You're touching our live setup.+"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Both, deliberately: your team learns by cleaning and automating their own system with a practitioner alongside, so the improvements and the skills stay after we leave. Pure lecture-style CRM training is why the last attempt didn't stick."
        },
        {
          "type": "summary",
          "text": "Should sales and marketing attend together?+"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Yes, at least for the shared-data sessions; half the value is both teams agreeing on the same pipeline definitions in the same room. Function-specific sessions then split where useful."
        }
